    26	- Session budget 4.5 h (`SESSION_BUDGET_S=16200`, reserve 900 s), stages ordered P0 → PA → PB → PC1–PC4 → PQ; cells the deadline cuts are recorded UNTESTED. Hard cap 6 pod-hours including setup and extraction.
