    10	                   vs extern GEMM kernels (ideal-cost class GEMM; SDPA excluded; f130)
    11	  aa_stats       --evidence-dir E --out J
    12	                 : E6 A/A matched pairs: per-block a-b differences and a
    13	                   block-level bootstrap interval (10,000 resamples, seed 20260921)
    14	  e9_check       --evidence-dir E --registration docs/phase3/e9/e9_cost_model.json --out J
