    19	                   range <arm>_pass_<i>), the GPU kernel/memop intervals inside it, the graph
    20	                   launches and memcpy API calls, and the union of CUDA API call intervals.
    21	                   Reports GPU-busy, GPU-idle-within-window and API-union fractions per arm;
    22	                   overlapping API durations are unioned, never summed, and no quantity is
