    26	                   at; do not refit and re-run"): the observed − predicted residual at each
    27	                   held-out length next to the in-sample residuals, and the single-term
    28	                   changes (rate_C3 or rate_H at that frame count) that would absorb it
    29	  e5_summary     --evidence-dir E --out J
