docs/phase4/revision/analysis_revision.md:27:At 8 s (`inventory_diff_session3.json`): the 420 parameter casts (0.915 ms) disappear; the attention kernels lose `cos/sin` from their fused ops (the rotary tables are constant-folded; time 1.352 → 1.384 ms, unchanged); the norm-plus-cast kernels shorten by 0.355 ms; launches 1143 → 729; class deltas sum 1.11 ms against an unprofiled 1.40 ms gain, leaving 0.29 ms unexplained by device class time. At 100 ms: casts 0.853 → 0, GEMM class 0.368 ms slower (frozen weights change the GEMM kernels chosen), sum 0.49 vs 0.67 ms unprofiled. The Phase-3 phrase "freezing folds more than the casts" is kept only for the rotary tables, which the source shows; the rest is reported as unexplained remainder. PC1/PC2 (inlining alone; freezing given inlining off) separate the two knobs.
